at all 36 sampled operators. Causality makes this a certified lower bound: inputs above band 40 cannot repair a missing target at band 36, and the $t^{42}$ x-side caveat is irrelevant to this finite-window obstruction. This projection-level stop remains valid even if CYCLIC-30 later discovers further output streams.

Replace the statement “all 1,080 blocks stop” by:

