codex
The D25 emission adds six genuinely free lift coordinates before imposing its five residuals, so the relevant incoming scheme is \(V_{23}\times\mathbb A^6\), of dimension \(17\), not dimension \(11\). I’m checking the exact affine coefficient matrix of those five rows now; this prevents the old 9–10 forecast from being carried forward with the wrong ambient count.
