   570	### 3.2 What the atlas coefficient classes mean
   571	
   572	Put `Delta=x57-x65`.  The exact modular template replayed on all atlas
   573	fibers is
   574	
   575	\[
   576	\begin{aligned}
   577	g_1={}&\Delta^2uW_1^2
   578	-2(r+2)h_1\frac{A_1}{A_2}x_{53}uW_1
   579	+\left(\frac92+3r\right)A_1^2x_{72},\\
   580	g_2={}&\Delta^2uW_2^2
   581	-2h_2x_{58}uW_2
