+## 4. D25: an exact pre-outcome reduction
+
+The present D25 emission makes a much sharper prediction possible than the
+older 9--10 forecast.  For each label, write
+
+\[
+B_\ell=S_p/I_{23,\ell},\qquad \dim B_\ell=11,
+\]
+
+and let
