+scope throughout is the residue-A, fixed-`r`, B-frozen, no-log, `PIN42`,
+`W1*W2 != 0` chart over the split primes
+`p=105337` and `p=105673`.  Nothing here promotes a
+characteristic-zero point, a formal germ, or a Keller pair.
+
