+ \bigl(q(g_2-\lambda g_1)\bigr)=0,
+\qquad
+\operatorname{NF}_{G_{21}}
+ \bigl(q(g_3-\mu g_1)\bigr)=0
+\tag{3.1}
+\]
+
+at both primes, with (2.10).  The degree-at-most-two quotient-syzygy map
