+
+### 3.4 What remains conjectural at D23
+
+> **CONJECTURE ECO-SOURCE.**  The transported modular family
+> \((q_\ell,\lambda_\ell,\mu_\ell)\), its torsion identities, and the
+> carrier/principalization construction descend from one
