+Because \(\dim V(J_{23})=11\) while
+\(\dim V(J_{23}+(q))=10\), no maximal 11-dimensional D23 component is
+contained in \(q=0\).  Hence saturation retains every maximal D23
+component and
+
+\[
+\dim V(J_{23}:q^\infty)=11.
+\tag{3.6}
+\]
