+## 5. Exact D25 lane predictions
+
+Combining (4.10) with CONJECTURE ECO-D25 gives
+
+\[
+\dim V_{25,\ell}=9+4=13.
+\tag{5.1}
+\]
+
+Equivalently, the residual system has:
