\tag{4.5}
\]

whose nonzero tail satisfies

\[
a_n=6a_{n-1}-6a_{n-2}.
\tag{4.6}
\]

Writing \(r^2=3\) and indexing this tail by \(a_0=1\), it also has the
exact closed form

\[
a_n=\frac{(3+r)^{n+1}-(3-r)^{n+1}}{2r}.
