+\[
+\boxed{
+T_\ell/(R_1,\ldots,R_5)
+\simeq
+\bigl(B_\ell/(h_{1,\ell},h_{2,\ell})\bigr)
+[u_1,u_2,u_3,u_4].}
+\tag{4.10}
+\]
+
+In particular,
