+| lane/object | verdict | global dimension | componentwise dimensions |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| `d25fam_p105337` selector union | NONEMPTY | 13 | \((13)^{36}\) |
+| `d25fam_p105673` selector union | NONEMPTY | 13 | \((13)^{36}\) |
